  "description": "Jae-Ha, who was dragged to a cross-dressing maid cafe by a friend's recommendation(?), falls in love at first sight with the maid in charge, Juno. While he is confused by the fact that he has fallen for a cross-dresser, he accidentally finds out that the student model Hyun-Woo, who contacted him for a departmental internship, is Juno...! \n\n*\"Oh, but instead of telling anyone... show me yourself in a maid outfit one more time.\"*\n\nHow can he fix his wrong first button to succeed in his first love?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
